    narr:narration """This hub documents the formalization of [Atlas rollback rehearsals](narr:Narrative_OperationalRehearsalInstitutionalization) into a recurring organizational cadence. As of August 2026, Quinton Fairweather has [mandated a monthly schedule](narr:Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_1) for these drills, explicitly [assigning ownership](narr:Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_4) to himself to ensure accountability. The directive is grounded in a [principle of operational readiness](narr:Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2) that rejects the existence of untested capabilities. The documentation [codifies this cadence](narr:Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_3) as a standing practice, shifting the activity from an ad-hoc response to a predictable, governed operational requirement.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_OperationalRehearsalInstitutionalization> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Atlas rollback rehearsals run monthly from now on." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "A rollback\nwe have not rehearsed is a rollback we do not actually have." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Cadence**: monthly Atlas rollback rehearsals" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The directive balances a calm, administrative tone regarding the schedule with an urgent, principle-based warning about the danger of unexercised systems." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1UnprotectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:writer "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite" .
